  "releaseNotes": "- Removes the standalone `TOOLS.md` editor, default content, configuration field,\n  and prompt assembly; Agents use `IDENTITY.md` and `AGENTS.md` for role rules\n- Resolves those role documents on every turn instead of replaying stale cached\n  instructions; clearing role documents also clears their derived instructions\n- Retains programmatic instructions and the platform-provided tool, memory,\n  SQL, MCP, workspace, and per-task temporary-file guidance for both Harnesses\n- Reuses Runtime `1.0.0-beta.24` and existing sandbox templates unchanged\n- Preserves existing model, Agent, API, sandbox, and concurrency configuration;\n  retired tool-document business notes are not automatically migrated",
